gametitle=Madden NFL 2004 (SLUS-20752) [14F8B841]
comment=P1 market commit guard -- the market stops re-shopping live double-team members. Cave in #11 (linker padding).

// Solution: docs/double-team-solution.md. Cave RELOCATED from the doc's
// 0x00139AA0 -- reachability census found that "dead" memcpy band is
// materialised into fp/s6/s7 by a selector at 0x00139DB0 (jalr-reachable).
// Cave #11 (0x00514920, linker padding, owned by no object) passed the full
// census: 0 jal, 0 lui/addiu refs, 0 data-word pointers, zero-filled in the
// ELF and in slot 9's own memory. Internal branches are relative (layout
// preserved); resume/skip jumps are absolute and unchanged.
